function motionPrompt(target:"male"|"female"|"both"){
const roles=target==="male"
?"Replace only the original male character with the man from the single uploaded Male reference image. Keep the original female character unchanged."
:target==="female"
?"Replace only the original female character with the woman from the single uploaded Female reference image. Keep the original male character unchanged."
:"Replace the original female character with the woman from Reference Image 1. Replace the original male character with the man from Reference Image 2.";
return roles+"\n\n"+MOTION_CONTROL_BASE+"\n\nUse the source video as the exact motion and camera reference. Use each uploaded identity photo only for its corresponding character identity. Do not treat identity photos as starting frames. Preserve all source-video actions and timing."
}
